===========================================================================
THIRD-PARTY CODE INCLUDED IN THIS REPOSITORY
===========================================================================

Two files are NOT covered by the MIT licence above. They are the
chunky-to-planar conversion kernels, and they are included verbatim, with
their original headers, as scene code has been shared and reused on the Amiga
for twenty-five years:

    native/c2p1x1_6_c5_bm_040.s     (c) Mikael Kalms <mikael@kalms.org>
    native/c2p_rect.s               (c) Mikael Kalms

The wrappers around them in native/c2p_glue.s are MIT, like the rest.
If you need a bare MIT tree, remove those two files and write your own c2p.


